  "releaseNotes": "- Allows switching from an unreachable Cube provider to the built-in sandbox\n  without waiting for remote environment cleanup; unfinished Runs still block\n  switching to protect in-flight work\n- Commits the provider configuration before scheduling durable, retryable old\n  workspace cleanup, with restart recovery and safeguards against deleting\n  reactivated workspaces or replacing pending cleanup connection settings\n- Detaches idle execution handles locally and resumes conversations from the\n  latest durable workspace checkpoint; unsynchronized remote changes are not\n  silently treated as recovered\n- Reuses Runtime `1.0.0-beta.19`; no Runtime or sandbox template rebuild required\n\nOffline bundles in this Core-only release update Core and retain an already installed Runtime 1.0.0-beta.19. Runtime archives remain available from the separate Runtime release.",
